-- Legacy scaling data fix (spec docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-15-legacy-scaling-design.md, audit legacy-scaling-audit.md).
-- Raises the level-1 difficulty rows of creatures spawned in Classic..Cataclysm instances, adds the rows for the
-- difficulty a solo player enters (10-player Normal for Classic..Wrath raids, flex Normal for Cataclysm raids),
-- and resets Ragnaros from 103 to 63. Re-runnable.
-- Block 1: level-1 difficulty rows of templates spawned in Classic..Cataclysm instances.
-- Convention (decided 2026-11-16): sibling row level where one exists, else boss cap+3, else cap+2; triggers stay 1.
